WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.900
Wannan bidiyon yana bayyana yanayin al'ada da rashin daidaituwa na jajayen bayyanar.

2
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Gwajin jajayen reflex na al'ada na al'ada shine lokacin da babu bambanci gaba ɗaya a cikin haske da launi tsakanin idanu biyu tare da hangen nesa na tsakiya.

3
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:31.530
Ko da bayyanar al'ada na reflex na asusun zai bambanta, ko da yake, ya bambanta dangane da nisan da kuke da kuma inda yaron yake kallo.

4
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:42.010
Yana da wani aiki mai ƙarfi jarrabawa inda ya kamata ka matsa gefe zuwa gefe da baya da baya a ciki da kuma kewaye da tsawon hannu daga majiyyaci.

5
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:51.350
Jarirai da yara kuma za su motsa hannayensu da idanuwansu, wanda hakan zai sa reflex ya canza yadda yake kallo yayin jarrabawa.

6
00:00:51.910 --> 00:01:02.350
A cikin baƙar fata, reflex yawanci yayi kama da kodadde, tare da rawaya da fari kuma wani lokacin ma shuɗi a matsayin babban launi.

7
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:14.970
Mahimmanci, a cikin jarrabawa ta al'ada, bai kamata a sami bambanci gaba ɗaya a cikin haske da launi tsakanin idanu biyu tare da tunani na tsakiya na tsakiya ba.

8
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:23.850
Matsala mara kyau ita ce lokacin da aka sami tsayin daka, ainihin bambanci a cikin haske da launi tsakanin idanu biyu.

9
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:35.840
Nunin yanayin da aka yi gudun hijira, duhun facin da ke akwai a cikin reflex na ido ɗaya ko idanu biyu, ko jajayen rashi gaba ɗaya.

10
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:56.330
Gwajin reflex mara kyau zai iya nuna kasancewar cataract, retinoblastoma, tabo na corneal, squint, kuskuren refractive ko matsalolin haihuwa kamar coloboma.

11
00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.690
Waɗannan duk suna buƙatar ƙarin kimantawa daga ƙwararrun ƙwararru.

12
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Dubi wannan reflex kuma ku tambayi kanku: shin wannan al'ada ce ko kuma ba ta da kyau? Amsoshin zasu biyo baya.

13
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:45.840
Ya kamata a yanzu ku sami kyakkyawar fahimta game da yadda yanayin reflex na yau da kullun yake kama, da kuma abubuwan da ba na al'ada ba, kuma ku iya ba da shawarar mafi yuwuwar sanadin.
